n        Clear, colored, cast, extruded, and specialty acrylic\n        for laser cutting and engraving.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"/#/article/en-268\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"leather\"> \n        Leather\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Genuine leather, PU leather, and specialty leather\n        materials for laser cutting and engraving.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"/#/article/en-269\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"wood\"> \n        Wood\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Plywood, MDF, solid wood, and other wood-based materials\n        for laser cutting and engraving.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/wood/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"fabric\"> \n        Fabric\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Natural and synthetic fabrics for laser cutting,\n        engraving, and creative applications.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/fabric/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div><div>\n\n\n</div><div>\n\n</div><div>\n\n  <h2 id=\"featured-guides\"> \n    Featured Guides\n  </h2>\n\n  <p>\n    Learn how to choose, process, and troubleshoot laser materials for better results.\n  </p>\n\n\n  \n\n  <div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"material-selection\"> \n        Material Selection\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Learn how to choose the right material based on type, thickness,\n        surface finish, application, and laser compatibility.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"laser-cutting\"> \n        Laser Cutting\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Learn how to achieve cleaner and more consistent cuts with proper\n        focus, power, speed, Air Assist, and material preparation.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"laser-engraving\"> \n        Laser Engraving\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Discover techniques for creating clear and detailed engravings,\n        including resolution, contrast, depth, and surface preparation.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"troubleshooting\"> \n        Troubleshooting\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Find solutions to common material processing problems such as\n        incomplete cuts, burning, melting, deformation, and uneven results.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div></div>","headings":[{"level":1,"id":"material-categories","text":"Material Categories"},{"level":2,"id":"acrylic","text":"Acrylic"},{"level":2,"id":"leather","text":"Leather"},{"level":2,"id":"wood","text":"Wood"},{"level":2,"id":"fabric","text":"Fabric"},{"level":1,"id":"featured-guides","text":"Featured Guides"},{"level":2,"id":"material-selection","text":"Material Selection"},{"level":2,"id":"laser-cutting","text":"Laser Cutting"},{"level":2,"id":"laser-engraving","text":"Laser Engraving"},{"level":2,"id":"troubleshooting","text":"Troubleshooting"}],"technical_version":"unknown"}